# Every named export of winmm.dll; the proxy forwards each one to the system DLL.
# The union of Wine's winmm (186 names) and mingw-w64's winmm.def, which follows
# Windows (209 names): 217 in all. A name the system DLL lacks (the Windows-only
# ones under Wine, the Wine-only ones under Windows) resolves to a stub returning 0.
# Windows' nameless ordinal 2 isn't forwarded.
# SDL3.dll imports timeBeginPeriod and timeEndPeriod, fmod.dll imports timeGetTime;
# nothing else in the game uses winmm.
